{"4169300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Operation: Outbreak", "steam_appid": 4169300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4179630, 4307940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>❗Important Notice❗</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a short 10–20 minute game, developed solo in a few weeks as a student exam project for a game development course. Due to budget limitations, AI was used for the voice-over. Please keep this in mind when playing and reviewing! Have fun!</strong><br> <br>After your squad’s vehicle is destroyed during a routine patrol in the war-torn streets of <strong>Karzekistan</strong>, you wake up as the sole survivor. As <strong>Nomad</strong>, you must navigate a city overrun by the undead to reach the extraction point on the far side. Comms are down, but through the radio, <strong>Sentinel</strong>, your squad’s coordinator, guides you toward survival: the city is crawling with fast, relentless zombies, and the only safe passage may be through the dark, narrow underground tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/a419bb56325a879e17c45294639c6972.poster.avif?t=1769938503\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/a419bb56325a879e17c45294639c6972.webm?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/a419bb56325a879e17c45294639c6972.mp4?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with only a pistol, you’ll face tense, survival-focused combat. Resources are scarce. Ammunition, healing items, and night vision are limited, making every shot and every decision crucial. Encountering large hordes of the undead can quickly turn fatal, forcing you to think strategically as you push forward through the decaying urban landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is cinematic and immersive: derelict buildings, abandoned streets, and flickering lights set the stage for relentless suspense. The tunnels below are tight, dark, and suffocating, while the city above teems with threats, culminating in a final, desperate push across a zombie-infested bridge to reach the landing zone where your extraction awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/3b9809fcf4c518a9af4c89ce5cbcc953.poster.avif?t=1769938503\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/3b9809fcf4c518a9af4c89ce5cbcc953.webm?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/3b9809fcf4c518a9af4c89ce5cbcc953.mp4?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, this short but intense <strong>10–20 minute FPS horror experience</strong> blends adrenaline-pumping action with survival horror, delivering a cinematic journey through a city teetering on the edge of chaos. Originally developed as a <strong>final exam project by DREADMITH Games</strong>, this game challenges your nerves, precision, and tactical thinking. Will you survive, or become another victim of the outbreak in Karzekistan?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>❗Important Notice❗</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a short 10–20 minute game, developed solo in a few weeks as a student exam project for a game development course. Due to budget limitations, AI was used for the voice-over. Please keep this in mind when playing and reviewing! Have fun!</strong><br> <br>After your squad’s vehicle is destroyed during a routine patrol in the war-torn streets of <strong>Karzekistan</strong>, you wake up as the sole survivor. As <strong>Nomad</strong>, you must navigate a city overrun by the undead to reach the extraction point on the far side. Comms are down, but through the radio, <strong>Sentinel</strong>, your squad’s coordinator, guides you toward survival: the city is crawling with fast, relentless zombies, and the only safe passage may be through the dark, narrow underground tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/a419bb56325a879e17c45294639c6972.poster.avif?t=1769938503\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/a419bb56325a879e17c45294639c6972.webm?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/a419bb56325a879e17c45294639c6972.mp4?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with only a pistol, you’ll face tense, survival-focused combat. Resources are scarce. Ammunition, healing items, and night vision are limited, making every shot and every decision crucial. Encountering large hordes of the undead can quickly turn fatal, forcing you to think strategically as you push forward through the decaying urban landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is cinematic and immersive: derelict buildings, abandoned streets, and flickering lights set the stage for relentless suspense. The tunnels below are tight, dark, and suffocating, while the city above teems with threats, culminating in a final, desperate push across a zombie-infested bridge to reach the landing zone where your extraction awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/3b9809fcf4c518a9af4c89ce5cbcc953.poster.avif?t=1769938503\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/3b9809fcf4c518a9af4c89ce5cbcc953.webm?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169300/extras/3b9809fcf4c518a9af4c89ce5cbcc953.mp4?t=1769938503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, this short but intense <strong>10–20 minute FPS horror experience</strong> blends adrenaline-pumping action with survival horror, delivering a cinematic journey through a city teetering on the edge of chaos. Originally developed as a <strong>final exam project by DREADMITH Games</strong>, this game challenges your nerves, precision, and tactical thinking. Will you survive, or become another victim of the outbreak in Karzekistan?</p>", "short_description": "Your squad's vehicle exploded during a patrol, and you're the only survivor. The enemy is unusual this time. A virus has turned the city into a warzone of the undead. Get to the exfil in time or die trying. A free-to-play short and intense FPS zombie survival horror game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It's The Perfect Christmas Treat... If You Like Shooting Zombies.”<br>ScreenRant<br><br>“...rivaling some of the best survival-horror indie games.”<br>Gam